    "Olaylar uygulaman\u0131n i\u00e7inde kal\u0131r; istersen ayn\u0131 uyar\u0131y\u0131 telefonunun uyar\u0131 merkezine veya Telegram'a da g\u00f6nder. Hi\u00e7biri zorunlu de\u011fil.": "Az esem\u00e9nyek az alkalmaz\u00e1son bel\u00fcl maradnak;ha akarja, k\u00fcldje el ugyanazt a figyelmeztet\u00e9st telefonja \u00e9rtes\u00edt\u00e9si k\u00f6zpontj\u00e1ba vagy a Telegramba.Ezek egyike sem k\u00f6telez\u0151.", // EN: Events stay inside the app; if you want, send the same alert to your phone's notification centre or to Telegram. None of these is required.
    "Konu ad\u0131 yaz, hesap gerekmez": "Adja meg a t\u00e9ma nev\u00e9t \u2013 nincs sz\u00fcks\u00e9g fi\u00f3kra", // EN: Enter a topic name — no account needed
    "Konu (topic)": "T\u00e9ma", // EN: Topic
    "Bildirimler ntfy.sh \u00fczerinde bu konuya g\u00f6nderilir; konu ad\u0131n\u0131 sadece sen biliyorsan bildirimi sadece sen al\u0131rs\u0131n.": "A t\u00e9m\u00e1hoz kapcsol\u00f3d\u00f3 \u00e9rtes\u00edt\u00e9sek az ntfy.sh webhelyen vannak k\u00f6zz\u00e9t\u00e9ve;ha csak te tudod a t\u00e9ma nev\u00e9t, csak te kapod meg.", // EN: Notifications are published to this topic on ntfy.sh; if only you know the topic name, only you receive them.
    "E-posta": "E-mail", // EN: Email
    "Uyar\u0131lar hesab\u0131n\u0131n e-posta adresine gider": "A figyelmeztet\u00e9seket fi\u00f3kja e-mail c\u00edm\u00e9re k\u00fcldj\u00fck", // EN: Alerts are sent to your account's email address
    "Bulut oturumu a\u00e7\u0131kken kendi adresine g\u00f6nderilir; saklanacak anahtar yok.": "Saj\u00e1t c\u00edm\u00e9re k\u00fcldve, amikor bejelentkezett;az alkalmaz\u00e1s nem t\u00e1rol titkokat.", // EN: Sent to your own address while signed in; no secrets are stored in the app.
    "G\u00f6nderilecek adres": "Befogad\u00f3", // EN: Recipient
    "Cihazlar Aras\u0131 Bildirim": "Eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k k\u00f6z\u00f6tti \u00e9rtes\u00edt\u00e9sek", // EN: Cross-device Notifications
    "Aile \u00fcyesinin uyar\u0131s\u0131, o ki\u015finin uygulamas\u0131 kapal\u0131yken de bildirim merkezine d\u00fc\u015fer": "Egy csal\u00e1dtag figyelmeztet\u00e9se akkor is meg\u00e9rkezik az \u00e9rtes\u00edt\u00e9si k\u00f6zpontba, ha az alkalmaz\u00e1s be van z\u00e1rva", // EN: A family member's alert arrives in the notification centre even when the app is closed
    "Di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin ve kendi di\u011fer cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n bildirim merkezine gider; al\u0131c\u0131 bu kanal\u0131 kendi cihaz\u0131nda a\u00e7m\u0131\u015f olmal\u0131.": "M\u00e1s tagok \u00e9s az \u00d6n egy\u00e9b eszk\u00f6zeinek \u00e9rtes\u00edt\u00e9si k\u00f6zpontjaira l\u00e9p;a c\u00edmzettnek enged\u00e9lyeznie kell ezt a csatorn\u00e1t az eszk\u00f6z\u00e9n.", // EN: Goes to other members' and your other devices' notification centres; the recipient must have this channel enabled on their device.
    "Kendi sunucuna JSON POST \u2014 geli\u015fmi\u015f": "JSON POST a saj\u00e1t szerver\u00e9re \u2013 fejlett", // EN: JSON POST to your own server — advanced
    "HTTPS adresi": "HTTPS URL", // EN: HTTPS URL
    "Yaln\u0131zca HTTPS kabul edilir; her olay {source, id, title, detail, ts} olarak g\u00f6nderilir.": "Csak HTTPS fogadhat\u00f3 el;minden esem\u00e9ny {forr\u00e1s, azonos\u00edt\u00f3, c\u00edm, r\u00e9szlet, ts} n\u00e9ven ker\u00fcl elk\u00fcld\u00e9sre.", // EN: Only HTTPS is accepted; each event is sent as {source, id, title, detail, ts}.
