    "Anahtar buluta y\u00fcklenmez; di\u011fer cihazlarda tekrar girmen gerekir.": "A token soha nem t\u00f6lt\u0151dik fel a felh\u0151be;\u00edrja be \u00fajra m\u00e1s eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k\u00f6n.", // EN: The token is never uploaded to the cloud; re-enter it on other devices.
