    "Sipari\u015flerim": "Megrendel\u00e9seim", // EN: My Orders
    "\u00d6deme ge\u00e7mi\u015fi (Sipari\u015flerim)": "Fizet\u00e9si el\u0151zm\u00e9nyek (Megrendel\u00e9seim)", // EN: Payment history (My Orders)
    "Faturaland\u0131rmay\u0131 y\u00f6net": "Sz\u00e1ml\u00e1z\u00e1s kezel\u00e9se", // EN: Manage billing
    "Sipari\u015fle ilgili sorun mu var? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Probl\u00e9ma a rendel\u00e9ssel?Visszajelz\u00e9s k\u00fcld\u00e9se", // EN: Problem with an order? Send feedback
    "Haz\u0131r olanlar \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r durumda; haz\u0131r olmayanlar \"Yak\u0131nda\" olarak i\u015faretlidir.": "A k\u00e9sz elemek most m\u0171k\u00f6dnek;A m\u00e9g nem k\u00e9sz t\u00e9telek \u201eHamarosan\u201d jelz\u00e9ssel vannak ell\u00e1tva.", // EN: Ready items work now; items that are not ready are marked "Coming soon".
    "Apple Watch Deste\u011fi Yak\u0131nda": "Apple Watch t\u00e1mogat\u00e1s hamarosan", // EN: Apple Watch Support Coming Soon
    "NEXUS hen\u00fcz Apple Watch uygulamas\u0131 i\u00e7ermiyor. Yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bile\u011finden senaryolar\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131p kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 g\u00f6rebileceksin.": "A NEXUS m\u00e9g nem tartalmaz Apple Watch alkalmaz\u00e1st.A kiad\u00e1s ut\u00e1n forgat\u00f3k\u00f6nyveket futtathat, \u00e9s kritikus figyelmeztet\u00e9seket l\u00e1that a csukl\u00f3j\u00e1r\u00f3l.", // EN: NEXUS does not include an Apple Watch app yet. Once released, you will be able to run scenarios and see critical alerts from your wrist.
    "Bug\u00fcn Ne Yapabilirsin": "Mit tehet ma", // EN: What You Can Do Today
    "Kritik olaylar i\u00e7in bildirimleri a\u00e7\u0131k tut; uyar\u0131lar\u0131 telefonunda hemen g\u00f6r\u00fcrs\u00fcn.": "Tartsa bekapcsolva az \u00e9rtes\u00edt\u00e9seket a kritikus esem\u00e9nyekr\u0151l;azonnal megjelenik a riaszt\u00e1s a telefonon.", // EN: Keep notifications on for critical events; you see alerts on your phone right away.
    "Saatinde bu bildirimlerin g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcp g\u00f6r\u00fcnmeyece\u011fi iPhone'unun Watch ayarlar\u0131na ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r; NEXUS saate \u00f6zel bir \u015fey g\u00f6ndermez.": "Az, hogy ezek az \u00e9rtes\u00edt\u00e9sek megjelennek-e az \u00f3r\u00e1j\u00e1n, az iPhone \u00f3ra be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sait\u00f3l f\u00fcgg;A NEXUS nem k\u00fcld semmi konkr\u00e9tat az \u00f3r\u00e1ra.", // EN: Whether these notifications show on your watch depends on your iPhone's Watch settings; NEXUS sends nothing specific to the watch.
    "Bildirim Ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "Nyissa meg az \u00c9rtes\u00edt\u00e9si be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sokat", // EN: Open Notification Settings
    "Anahtar\u0131 kopyala": "Kulcs m\u00e1sol\u00e1sa", // EN: Copy key
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7": "Nyissa meg a hiteles\u00edt\u0151 alkalmaz\u00e1sban", // EN: Open in authenticator app
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131na eri\u015fimini kaybedersen giri\u015fte kod istenece\u011fi i\u00e7in hesab\u0131na giremezsin. Bu anahtar\u0131 g\u00fcvenli bir yere kaydet.": "Ha elvesz\u00edti hozz\u00e1f\u00e9r\u00e9s\u00e9t hiteles\u00edt\u0151 alkalmaz\u00e1s\u00e1hoz, nem fog tudni bejelentkezni, mert a bejelentkez\u00e9skor k\u00f3dot kell megadni.Mentse el ezt a kulcsot egy biztons\u00e1gos helyre.", // EN: If you lose access to your authenticator app you won't be able to sign in, because a code is required at login. Save this key somewhere safe.
    "Anahtar kopyaland\u0131 \u2713": "Kulcs m\u00e1solva \u2713", // EN: Key copied ✓
    "Kopyalanamad\u0131; anahtar\u0131 elle yaz.": "Nem siker\u00fclt m\u00e1solni;k\u00e9zzel \u00edrja be a kulcsot.", // EN: Couldn't copy; type the key by hand.
    "6 haneli kod": "6 sz\u00e1mjegy\u0171 k\u00f3d", // EN: 6-digit code
    "Do\u011frula": "Ellen\u0151rizze", // EN: Verify
    "Yak\u0131nda": "Hamarosan", // EN: Coming soon
    "Hesab\u0131m": "Saj\u00e1t fi\u00f3k", // EN: My Account
    "Hesab\u0131m\u0131 Sil": "Saj\u00e1t fi\u00f3k t\u00f6rl\u00e9se", // EN: Delete My Account
    "Hesab\u0131n, profilin ve senkronize verilerin kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinir. Aktif NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fin varsa \u00f6nce Faturaland\u0131rma'dan iptal et. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.": "Fi\u00f3kja, profilja \u00e9s szinkroniz\u00e1lt adatai v\u00e9glegesen t\u00f6rl\u0151dnek.Ha akt\u00edv NEXUS+-el\u0151fizet\u00e9se van, el\u0151sz\u00f6r mondja le a sz\u00e1ml\u00e1z\u00e1sb\u00f3l.Ezt nem lehet visszavonni.", // EN: Your account, profile and synced data are permanently deleted. If you have an active NEXUS+ subscription, cancel it from Billing first. This cannot be undone.
    "Emin misin? Tekrar dokunarak sil": "Biztos vagy benne?Koppintson \u00fajra a t\u00f6rl\u00e9shez", // EN: Are you sure? Tap again to delete
    "Siliniyor\u2026": "T\u00f6rl\u00e9s\u2026", // EN: Deleting…
    "Hesap silindi. Aboneli\u011fini Whop hesab\u0131ndan iptal etmeyi unutma.": "Fi\u00f3k t\u00f6r\u00f6lve.Ne felejtse el lemondani az el\u0151fizet\u00e9st a Whop-fi\u00f3kj\u00e1b\u00f3l.", // EN: Account deleted. Remember to cancel your subscription from your Whop account.
    "Hesab\u0131n ve verilerin silindi.": "Fi\u00f3kj\u00e1t \u00e9s adatait t\u00f6r\u00f6lt\u00fck.", // EN: Your account and data were deleted.
    "Bu cihazdaki NEXUS verilerini silmek i\u00e7in Ayarlar \u2192 \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Yap yeterli; bulut hesab\u0131 yok.": "A NEXUS-adatok elt\u00e1vol\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1hoz az eszk\u00f6zr\u0151l elegend\u0151 a Be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sok \u2192 Kijelentkez\u00e9s men\u00fcpont;nincs felh\u0151fi\u00f3k.", // EN: To remove NEXUS data on this device, Settings → Sign out is enough; there is no cloud account.
    "Hesap silme fonksiyonu hen\u00fcz da\u011f\u0131t\u0131lmad\u0131. \u015eimdilik \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yapabilirsin.": "A szerveroldali fi\u00f3kt\u00f6rl\u00e9s m\u00e9g nincs telep\u00edtve.Egyel\u0151re kijelentkezhet.", // EN: The server-side account deletion isn't deployed yet. You can sign out for now.
    "! Rahats\u0131z etme modunu a\u00e7t\u0131m, hi\u00e7bir bildirim seni rahats\u0131z etmeyecek. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]": "!Bekapcsoltam a Ne zavarjanak funkci\u00f3t;semmilyen \u00e9rtes\u00edt\u00e9s nem fog zavarni.[ACTION: ENABLE_DND]", // EN: ! I turned on Do Not Disturb; no notifications will bother you. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]
    "\" senaryosunu \u015fimdilik ana ekrandaki T\u0131kla ve \u00c7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r kart\u0131ndan tek dokunu\u015fla \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilirsin. NEXUS App Store'da yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bu ekrandan do\u011frudan Siri'ye ekleyebileceksin.": "\" forgat\u00f3k\u00f6nyv egyel\u0151re egyetlen \u00e9rint\u00e9ssel futtathat\u00f3 a kezd\u0151k\u00e9perny\u0151n tal\u00e1lhat\u00f3 Tap to Run k\u00e1rty\u00e1r\u00f3l. Ha a NEXUS az App Store-ban van, k\u00f6zvetlen\u00fcl err\u0151l a k\u00e9perny\u0151r\u0151l adhatja hozz\u00e1 a Sirihez.", // EN: " scenario can be run with one tap from the Tap to Run card on the home screen for now. Once NEXUS is on the App Store, you'll be able to add it to Siri directly from this screen.
    "\" ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinecek. Emin misin?": "\", \u00e9s minden be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sa v\u00e9glegesen t\u00f6rl\u0151dik.Biztos vagy benne?", // EN: " and all its settings will be deleted permanently. Are you sure?
