    "Aboneli\u011finiz yok \u2014 t\u00fcm \u00f6zellikler \u015fu an \u00fccretsiz. NEXUS+ yak\u0131nda.": "Nincs el\u0151fizet\u00e9se \u2013 jelenleg minden funkci\u00f3 ingyenes.A NEXUS+ hamarosan megjelenik.", // EN: You don't have a subscription — every feature is free right now. NEXUS+ is coming soon.
