    "Acil Durum D\u00fc\u011fmesi (Bluetooth)": "V\u00e9szhelyzeti gomb (Bluetooth)", // EN: Emergency Button (Bluetooth)
    "Acil Durum D\u00fc\u011fmesi (Zigbee)": "V\u00e9szgomb (Zigbee)", // EN: Emergency Button (Zigbee)
    "Acil Durumlar": "V\u00e9szhelyzetek", // EN: Emergencies
    "Ad": "N\u00e9v", // EN: Name
    "Ad Soyad": "Teljes n\u00e9v", // EN: Full Name
    "Kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131": "Felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3n\u00e9v", // EN: Username
    "Adres biliyorsan tek tek yaz, bilmiyorsan modem a\u011f\u0131n\u0131n \u00f6n ekini b\u0131rak (192.168.1 gibi) \u2014 NEXUS 254 adresi birlikte yoklar.": "Ha tudja a c\u00edmet, \u00edrja be;ha nem, hagyja meg az \u00fatv\u00e1laszt\u00f3 h\u00e1l\u00f3zati el\u0151tagj\u00e1t (p\u00e9ld\u00e1ul 192.168.1) \u2013 a NEXUS mind a 254 c\u00edmet ellen\u0151rzi.", // EN: If you know the address, type it; if not, leave your router network prefix (like 192.168.1) — NEXUS checks all 254 addresses.
    "Adres veya semt ara": "Keressen c\u00edmet vagy k\u00f6rny\u00e9ket", // EN: Search address or neighborhood
    "Ads\u0131z cihaz": "N\u00e9vtelen eszk\u00f6z", // EN: Unnamed device
    "Aile": "Csal\u00e1d", // EN: Family
    "Aile mesajla\u015fma \u00f6zelli\u011fi": "Csal\u00e1di \u00fczenetk\u00fcld\u0151 funkci\u00f3", // EN: Family messaging feature
    "Aksiyon \u00d6zeti": "Akci\u00f3 \u00f6sszefoglal\u00e1sa", // EN: Action Summary
    "Aktar\u0131lan Cihaz": "\u00c1thidalt eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k", // EN: Bridged Devices
    "Aktif": "Akt\u00edv", // EN: Active
    "Aktif \u00b7 G\u00fcvenli": "Akt\u00edv \u00b7 Biztons\u00e1gos", // EN: Active · Secure
    "\u00d6nce bir cihaz ekle": "El\u0151sz\u00f6r adjon hozz\u00e1 egy eszk\u00f6zt", // EN: Add a device first
    "\u00c7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce": "Miel\u0151tt elm\u00e9sz", // EN: Before you leave
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n son bilinen durumu. Okunmayan bir de\u011fer varsa \"Durum okunmad\u0131\" yazar.": "Eszk\u00f6zeinek utols\u00f3 ismert \u00e1llapota.A be nem olvasott \u00e9rt\u00e9k a \u201eNem olvasott \u00e1llapot\u201d \u00fczenetet jelzi.", // EN: Last known state of your devices. A value that was not read shows "State not read".
    "A\u00c7IK G\u00d6R\u00dcNEN C\u0130HAZLAR": "AZ ESZK\u00d6Z\u00d6K, AMELYEK MEGJELENIK", // EN: DEVICES THAT APPEAR ON
    "A\u00e7\u0131k g\u00f6r\u00fcnen cihaz yok.": "\u00dagy t\u0171nik, nincs bekapcsolva eszk\u00f6z.", // EN: No device appears to be on.
    "G\u00dcVENL\u0130K C\u0130HAZLARI": "BIZTONS\u00c1GI ESZK\u00d6Z\u00d6K", // EN: SECURITY DEVICES
    "Kilit, kap\u0131 sens\u00f6r\u00fc veya kamera eklenmemi\u015f.": "Nincs hozz\u00e1adva z\u00e1r, ajt\u00f3\u00e9rz\u00e9kel\u0151 vagy kamera.", // EN: No lock, door sensor or camera added.
    "Durum okunmad\u0131": "\u00c1llapot nem olvasta", // EN: State not read
    "Bu zaten \u015fu an kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131n e-posta adresi. Farkl\u0131 bir adres gir.": "Ez m\u00e1r az \u00d6n \u00e1ltal haszn\u00e1lt e-mail c\u00edm.Adjon meg egy m\u00e1sikat.", // EN: This is already the email address you are using. Enter a different one.
    "Bu e-posta adresi ba\u015fka bir hesapta kay\u0131tl\u0131. Ba\u015fka bir adres dene.": "Ez az e-mail c\u00edm egy m\u00e1sik fi\u00f3khoz van regisztr\u00e1lva.Pr\u00f3b\u00e1ljon ki egy m\u00e1sikat.", // EN: This email address is registered to another account. Try a different one.
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denendi. Birka\u00e7 dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "T\u00fal sok pr\u00f3b\u00e1lkoz\u00e1s.Pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja \u00fajra n\u00e9h\u00e1ny perc m\u00falva.", // EN: Too many attempts. Try again in a few minutes.
    "\u00c7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131": "Offline", // EN: Offline
    "Hedef okunmad\u0131": "A c\u00e9l nem olvashat\u00f3", // EN: Target not read
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm verisi yok": "Nincsenek m\u00e9r\u00e9si adatok", // EN: No measurement data
    "Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar hen\u00fcz s\u0131cakl\u0131k, nem veya hava kalitesi verisi vermedi. Sens\u00f6r\u00fcn a\u00e7\u0131k ve a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Eszk\u00f6zei m\u00e9g nem jelentettek h\u0151m\u00e9rs\u00e9kletet, p\u00e1ratartalmat vagy leveg\u0151min\u0151s\u00e9get.Gy\u0151z\u0151dj\u00f6n meg arr\u00f3l, hogy az \u00e9rz\u00e9kel\u0151 be van kapcsolva, \u00e9s csatlakozik a h\u00e1l\u00f3zathoz.", // EN: Your devices have not reported temperature, humidity or air quality yet. Make sure the sensor is on and on the network.
    "Son okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler": "Leg\u00fajabb olvasm\u00e1nyok", // EN: Latest readings
    "Skor \u00fcretmiyoruz; yaln\u0131zca cihazlardan okunan ger\u00e7ek de\u011ferler g\u00f6sterilir.": "Nem k\u00e9sz\u00edt\u00fcnk kott\u00e1t;csak az eszk\u00f6zeir\u0151l olvasott val\u00f3s \u00e9rt\u00e9kek jelennek meg.", // EN: We do not produce a score; only real values read from your devices are shown.
    "Haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 bitirdi\u011finde \u015fu cihazlara uygulan\u0131r.": "Ha v\u00e9gzett, ez a k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 eszk\u00f6z\u00f6kre vonatkozik.", // EN: When you finish, this is applied to the following devices.
    "Uyku haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in uygun cihaz yok": "Nincs megfelel\u0151 eszk\u00f6z az alv\u00e1s el\u0151k\u00e9sz\u00edt\u00e9s\u00e9re", // EN: No suitable device for sleep preparation
    "I\u015f\u0131k, perde, kilit veya iklim cihaz\u0131 ekledi\u011finde haz\u0131rl\u0131k burada listelenir.": "Amint hozz\u00e1ad egy l\u00e1mp\u00e1t, f\u00fcgg\u00f6nyt, z\u00e1rat vagy kl\u00edmaberendez\u00e9st, a k\u00e9sz\u00edtm\u00e9ny itt l\u00e1that\u00f3.", // EN: Once you add a light, curtain, lock or climate device, the preparation is listed here.
    "\u0130klim cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n son bilinen durumu ve okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler.": "Kl\u00edmaberendez\u00e9seinek utols\u00f3 ismert \u00e1llapota \u00e9s \u00e9rt\u00e9kei.", // EN: Last known state and readings of your climate devices.
    "Kamera gizlili\u011fi": "Kamera adatv\u00e9delem", // EN: Camera privacy
    "Her kameran\u0131n gizlilik modunu ayr\u0131 ayr\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Az egyes kamer\u00e1k adatv\u00e9delmi m\u00f3dj\u00e1t k\u00fcl\u00f6n kezelheti.", // EN: Manage each camera's privacy mode separately.
    "Kamera cihaz\u0131 yok": "Nincs kamera eszk\u00f6z", // EN: No camera device
    "Kamera ekledi\u011finde gizlilik modu her kamera i\u00e7in burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Ha hozz\u00e1ad egy kamer\u00e1t, itt megjelenik annak adatv\u00e9delmi m\u00f3dja.", // EN: Once you add a camera, its privacy mode appears here.
    "Bu senaryoyu uygulayacak uygun cihaz yok": "Nincs megfelel\u0151 eszk\u00f6z ennek a forgat\u00f3k\u00f6nyvnek a futtat\u00e1s\u00e1hoz", // EN: No suitable device to run this scenario
    "I\u015f\u0131k, perde, klima veya kilit gibi uyumlu bir cihaz ekledi\u011finde burada listelenir.": "Ha hozz\u00e1ad egy kompatibilis eszk\u00f6zt, p\u00e9ld\u00e1ul l\u00e1mp\u00e1t, f\u00fcgg\u00f6nyt, l\u00e9gkondicion\u00e1l\u00f3t vagy z\u00e1rat, az itt megjelenik.", // EN: Once you add a compatible device such as a light, curtain, air conditioner or lock, it is listed here.
