    "Ana ekran\u0131n sa\u011f \u00fcst\u00fcndeki + butonuna dokunun ve \"Tara\" ile cihaz\u0131n QR kodunu okutun ya da kurulum kodunu elle girin.": "\u00c9rintse meg a + gombot a kezd\u0151k\u00e9perny\u0151 jobb fels\u0151 sark\u00e1ban, \u00e9s olvassa be az eszk\u00f6z QR-k\u00f3dj\u00e1t a \u201eScan\u201d funkci\u00f3val, vagy \u00edrja be k\u00e9zzel a be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si k\u00f3dot.", // EN: Tap the + button at the top right of the home screen and scan the device's QR code with "Scan", or enter the setup code manually.
