    "Bilgilerini girdikten sonra g\u00f6nderilecek ad\u0131mlar\u0131 takip ederek \u015fifreni kolayca yenileyebilirsin.": "Az adatok megad\u00e1sa ut\u00e1n egyszer\u0171en vissza\u00e1ll\u00edthatja jelszav\u00e1t az \u00e1ltalunk k\u00fcld\u00f6tt l\u00e9p\u00e9sek k\u00f6vet\u00e9s\u00e9vel.", // EN: After entering your details, you can easily reset your password by following the steps we send.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131nda NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kullan; ayn\u0131 asistan ve kontroller orada da \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Haszn\u00e1lja a NEXUS asztali alkalmaz\u00e1st sz\u00e1m\u00edt\u00f3g\u00e9p\u00e9n;ugyanaz az asszisztens \u00e9s a vez\u00e9rl\u0151k m\u0171k\u00f6dnek ott is.", // EN: Use the NEXUS desktop app on your computer; the same assistant and controls work there too.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131ndan da sohbet et; konu\u015fmalar\u0131n t\u00fcm cihazlar\u0131nda senkronize kal\u0131r.": "Cseveg\u00e9s a sz\u00e1m\u00edt\u00f3g\u00e9pr\u0151l is;besz\u00e9lget\u00e9sei szinkronban maradnak az eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k\u00f6n.", // EN: Chat from your computer too; your conversations stay in sync across your devices.
    "Bir Eve Kat\u0131l": "Csatlakozz egy otthonhoz", // EN: Join a Home
    "Bir cihaz a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya kapand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Amikor egy eszk\u00f6z be- vagy kikapcsol", // EN: When a device turns on or off
    "Bir cihaza dokununca panelin kontrol ekran\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r; ekranda yaln\u0131zca o cihaz\u0131n destekledi\u011fi \u00f6zellikler g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Shelly, WLED ve ESPHome cihazlar\u0131nda a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k do\u011frudan cihaza gider.": "\u00c9rintsen meg egy eszk\u00f6zt a panel vez\u00e9rl\u0151k\u00e9perny\u0151j\u00e9nek megnyit\u00e1s\u00e1hoz;csak az eszk\u00f6z \u00e1ltal t\u00e1mogatott funkci\u00f3kat mutatja.Shelly, WLED \u00e9s ESPHome eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k eset\u00e9n a be-/kikapcsol\u00e1s \u00e9s a f\u00e9nyer\u0151 egyenesen az eszk\u00f6zre megy.", // EN: Tap a device to open the panel's control screen; it shows only the features that device supports. For Shelly, WLED and ESPHome devices, on/off and brightness go straight to the device.
    "Bir eve kat\u0131l ekran\u0131nda bu kod kullan\u0131l\u0131r.": "Ez a k\u00f3d a Csatlakoz\u00e1s kezd\u0151k\u00e9perny\u0151n haszn\u00e1lhat\u00f3.", // EN: This code is used on the Join a Home screen.
    "Bir kez dokunman\u0131z yeterli": "Egy koppint\u00e1s el\u00e9g", // EN: One tap is all it takes
    "Bir plan olu\u015fturdu\u011funda saat ve aksiyonlar burada ger\u00e7ek verilerle g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "A terv elk\u00e9sz\u00edt\u00e9se ut\u00e1n itt jelennek meg az id\u0151pontok \u00e9s a m\u0171veletek val\u00f3s adatokkal.", // EN: Once you create a plan, times and actions will appear here with real data.
    "Bir plan olu\u015fturunca burada g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "A terv l\u00e9trehoz\u00e1sa ut\u00e1n megjelenik itt.", // EN: It will appear here once you create a plan.
