    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Ez a 8 sz\u00e1mjegy\u0171 k\u00f3d az Apple HomeKit p\u00e1ros\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1ra szolg\u00e1l, \u00e9s csak az Apple Home alkalmaz\u00e1ssal m\u0171k\u00f6dik.Ha az eszk\u00f6z t\u00e1mogatja a helyi API-t, p\u00e9ld\u00e1ul a Shelly-t, a WLED-et vagy a Tasmot\u00e1t, hozz\u00e1adhatja a helyi h\u00e1l\u00f3zatr\u00f3l.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "Ez a K\u00e9sz\u00fcl\u00e9k", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Ez a QR-k\u00f3d Wi-Fi h\u00e1l\u00f3zathoz tartozik, nem eszk\u00f6zh\u00f6z.Miut\u00e1n csatlakoztatta az eszk\u00f6zt ugyanahhoz a h\u00e1l\u00f3zathoz, hozz\u00e1adhatja a helyi h\u00e1l\u00f3zatr\u00f3l.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Ezen a c\u00edmen nem tal\u00e1lhat\u00f3 ismert NEXUS-eszk\u00f6z.Gy\u0151z\u0151dj\u00f6n meg arr\u00f3l, hogy az eszk\u00f6z be van kapcsolva, \u00e9s ugyanabban a h\u00e1l\u00f3zatban van.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
    "Bu ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulamay\u0131 olu\u015ftur:": "Hozd l\u00e9tre ezt az intelligens alkalmaz\u00e1st:", // EN: Create this smart app:
    "Bu ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilen \u00f6zellikler haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor.": "Javasolt szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1sok el\u0151k\u00e9sz\u00edt\u00e9se ehhez a folyamathoz.", // EN: Preparing suggested features for this flow.
    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "Ebben a h\u00f3napban mentve", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "Nem tal\u00e1lhat\u00f3 t\u00e1mogatott eszk\u00f6z ezen a h\u00e1l\u00f3zaton.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "Nem tal\u00e1lhat\u00f3 t\u00e1mogatott eszk\u00f6z ezen a h\u00e1l\u00f3zaton.Gy\u0151z\u0151dj\u00f6n meg arr\u00f3l, hogy az eszk\u00f6z be van kapcsolva, \u00e9s ugyanahhoz a Wi-Fi-h\u00e1l\u00f3zathoz csatlakozik;ellenkez\u0151 esetben haszn\u00e1lja az al\u00e1bbi katal\u00f3gust vagy egy QR / be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si k\u00f3dot.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
    "Bu cihaz i\u00e7in yerel koruma": "Helyi v\u00e9delem ehhez az eszk\u00f6zh\u00f6z", // EN: Local protection for this device
    "Bu cihaz s\u00fcr\u00fcm bilgisi payla\u015fm\u0131yor": "Ez az eszk\u00f6z nem osztja meg a verzi\u00f3inform\u00e1ci\u00f3kat", // EN: This device doesn't share version info
    "Bu cihaz veya ba\u011flant\u0131 fener deste\u011fi sunmuyor.": "Ez az eszk\u00f6z vagy csatlakoz\u00e1s nem t\u00e1mogatja a zsebl\u00e1mp\u00e1t.", // EN: This device or connection doesn't support the flashlight.
    "Bu cihazda otomatik konum deste\u011fi yok.": "Ez az eszk\u00f6z nem t\u00e1mogatja az automatikus helymeghat\u00e1roz\u00e1st.", // EN: This device doesn't support automatic location.
    "Bu davet kodu bulunamad\u0131.": "Ez a megh\u00edv\u00f3 k\u00f3d nem tal\u00e1lhat\u00f3.", // EN: This invite code wasn't found.
    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "Ez a k\u00e9perny\u0151 helyis\u00e9genk\u00e9nt csoportos\u00edtja a hozz\u00e1adott vil\u00e1g\u00edt\u00f3eszk\u00f6z\u00f6ket;jelenet ment\u00e9sekor a f\u00e9nyer\u0151 \u00e9s a t\u00f3nus egy\u00fctt lesznek be\u00e1ll\u00edtva.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "Az otthonhoz hozz\u00e1adott eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k list\u00e1ja itt tal\u00e1lhat\u00f3.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Az otthonhoz hozz\u00e1adott eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k itt vannak felsorolva, \u00e9s a kedvenc k\u00e1rty\u00e1ihoz vannak kapcsolva.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "Biztos benne, hogy v\u00e9glegesen t\u00f6rli ezt az otthont \u00e9s az \u00f6sszes be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1t?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
    "Bu kod desteklenen bir cihaz kodu de\u011fil. Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini biliyorsan yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Ez a k\u00f3d nem t\u00e1mogatott eszk\u00f6zk\u00f3d.Ha ismeri az eszk\u00f6z IP-c\u00edm\u00e9t, hozz\u00e1adhatja a helyi h\u00e1l\u00f3zatr\u00f3l.", // EN: This code isn't a supported device code. If you know the device's IP address, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu markalar yerel a\u011fdan kontrol edilir": "Ezeket a m\u00e1rk\u00e1kat a helyi h\u00e1l\u00f3zaton kereszt\u00fcl ir\u00e1ny\u00edtj\u00e1k", // EN: These brands are controlled over your local network
    "Bu mini uygulama resm\u00ee sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan sunulur.": "Ezt a minialkalmaz\u00e1st a hivatalos szolg\u00e1ltat\u00f3 biztos\u00edtja.", // EN: This mini app is provided by the official provider.
    "Bu ortam kamera eri\u015fimini desteklemiyor.": "Ez a k\u00f6rnyezet nem t\u00e1mogatja a kamera hozz\u00e1f\u00e9r\u00e9s\u00e9t.", // EN: This environment doesn't support camera access.
    "Bu ortamda a\u011f taramas\u0131 kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "A h\u00e1l\u00f3zati szkennel\u00e9s itt nem \u00e9rhet\u0151 el.", // EN: Network scanning isn't available here.
    "Bu ortamda g\u00fcvenli \u015fifreleme yok": "Ebben a k\u00f6rnyezetben nincs biztons\u00e1gos titkos\u00edt\u00e1s", // EN: No secure encryption in this environment
    "Bu senaryo aktifle\u015fti\u011finde ilgili cihazlar otomatik olarak ayarlan\u0131r.": "Amikor ez a forgat\u00f3k\u00f6nyv fut, a kapcsol\u00f3d\u00f3 eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k automatikusan be\u00e1llnak.", // EN: When this scenario runs, the related devices are adjusted automatically.
    "Bu senaryodan etkilenen cihaz yok \u2014 \u00f6nce uygun cihaz ekle.": "Ez a forgat\u00f3k\u00f6nyv egyetlen eszk\u00f6zt sem \u00e9rint \u2013 el\u0151sz\u00f6r adjon hozz\u00e1 egy megfelel\u0151 eszk\u00f6zt.", // EN: No devices are affected by this scenario — add a suitable device first.
    "Bu senaryoyu kullanmak i\u00e7in uyumlu cihaz eklemelisin.": "Ennek a forgat\u00f3k\u00f6nyvnek a haszn\u00e1lat\u00e1hoz hozz\u00e1 kell adnia egy kompatibilis eszk\u00f6zt.", // EN: You need to add a compatible device to use this scenario.
    "Bu tek evin. Silersen bo\u015f bir \"Evim\" yeniden olu\u015fturulur. Devam edilsin mi?": "Ez az egyetlen otthonod.Ha t\u00f6rli, egy \u00fcres \"Saj\u00e1t Otthon\" j\u00f6n l\u00e9tre \u00fajra.Folytatja?", // EN: This is your only home. If you delete it, an empty "My Home" will be created again. Continue?
