    "Bunu tam \u00e7\u00f6zemedim. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki formdan ekibimize geri bildirim g\u00f6nderirsen en k\u0131sa s\u00fcrede d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f yapal\u0131m; ya da \"Tam sohbeti a\u00e7\" ile devam edebilirsin.": "Nem tudtam teljesen megoldani.K\u00fcldj\u00f6n visszajelz\u00e9st csapatunknak az al\u00e1bbi \u0171rlap seg\u00edts\u00e9g\u00e9vel, \u00e9s amint tudunk, felvessz\u00fck \u00d6nnel a kapcsolatot, vagy folytassa a \u201eTeljes cseveg\u00e9s megnyit\u00e1sa\u201d lehet\u0151s\u00e9ggel.", // EN: I couldn't fully solve that. Send our team feedback with the form below and we'll get back to you as soon as we can, or continue with "Open full chat".
