    "Yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda saklan\u0131r; hi\u00e7bir yere y\u00fcklenmez.": "Csak ezen az eszk\u00f6z\u00f6n t\u00e1rolva;soha nem t\u00f6lt\u00f6ttem fel sehova.", // EN: Stored only on this device; never uploaded anywhere.
