    "Foto\u011fraf\u0131 kald\u0131r": "Fot\u00f3 elt\u00e1vol\u00edt\u00e1sa", // EN: Remove photo
    "Foto\u011fraf kaydedilemedi; cihaz depolamas\u0131 dolu olabilir.": "Nem siker\u00fclt menteni a f\u00e9nyk\u00e9pet;az eszk\u00f6z t\u00e1rhelye megtelt.", // EN: Couldn't save the photo; device storage may be full.
    "Se\u00e7ilen dosya bir resim de\u011fil.": "A kiv\u00e1lasztott f\u00e1jl nem k\u00e9p.", // EN: The selected file is not an image.
    "Foto\u011fraf \u00e7ok b\u00fcy\u00fck kald\u0131; daha k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck bir resim dene.": "A f\u00e9nyk\u00e9p m\u00e9g mindig t\u00fal nagy;pr\u00f3b\u00e1lj meg egy kisebb k\u00e9pet.", // EN: The photo is still too large; try a smaller image.
    "Foto\u011fraf okunamad\u0131; ba\u015fka bir dosya dene.": "Nem siker\u00fclt elolvasni a f\u00e9nyk\u00e9pet;pr\u00f3b\u00e1lkozzon m\u00e1sik f\u00e1jllal.", // EN: Couldn't read the photo; try another file.
    "Foto\u011fraf kald\u0131r\u0131lamad\u0131.": "Nem siker\u00fclt elt\u00e1vol\u00edtani a f\u00e9nyk\u00e9pet.", // EN: Couldn't remove the photo.
    "Cihaz durumu de\u011fi\u015fti\u011finde senaryolar\u0131 tetikle": "A forgat\u00f3k\u00f6nyvek aktiv\u00e1l\u00e1sa, amikor az eszk\u00f6z \u00e1llapota megv\u00e1ltozik", // EN: Trigger scenarios when a device's status changes
    "Cihaz ekle": "Eszk\u00f6z hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa", // EN: Add device
    "Cihaz ekledik\u00e7e paneller burada olu\u015fur": "Eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sakor itt jelennek meg a panelek", // EN: Panels appear here as you add devices
    "Cihaz ekledik\u00e7e tasarrufun burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Megtakar\u00edt\u00e1sai itt jelennek meg, amikor eszk\u00f6z\u00f6ket ad hozz\u00e1.", // EN: Your savings appear here as you add devices.
    "Cihaz ekleme merkezi": "Eszk\u00f6zk\u00f6zpont", // EN: Device center
    "Cihaz eklenince h\u0131zl\u0131 olu\u015fturma \u00f6nerileri burada g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "Eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa ut\u00e1n gyors l\u00e9trehoz\u00e1si javaslatok jelennek meg itt.", // EN: Quick creation suggestions will appear here once you add devices.
    "Cihaz eklenince kontrol g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "A vez\u00e9rl\u0151k az eszk\u00f6z hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa ut\u00e1n jelennek meg.", // EN: Controls appear once a device is added.
    "Cihaz g\u00fcncellemeleri": "Eszk\u00f6zfriss\u00edt\u00e9sek", // EN: Device updates
    "Cihaz kald\u0131r\u0131ls\u0131n m\u0131?": "Elt\u00e1vol\u00edtja a k\u00e9sz\u00fcl\u00e9ket?", // EN: Remove the device?
    "Cihaz tan\u0131n\u0131yor\u2026": "Az eszk\u00f6z azonos\u00edt\u00e1sa\u2026", // EN: Identifying the device…
    "Cihaz uyar\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131, \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131 kay\u0131tlar\u0131n\u0131 ve \u00f6nemli durum mesajlar\u0131n\u0131 tek merkezden takip edin.": "K\u00f6vesse nyomon az eszk\u00f6zriaszt\u00e1sokat, a h\u00edv\u00e1snapl\u00f3kat \u00e9s a fontos \u00e1llapot\u00fczeneteket egy k\u00f6zpontb\u00f3l.", // EN: Track device alerts, call logs and important status messages from one center.
