    "Cihaz \u00fczerindeki tu\u015fu kilitler": "Z\u00e1rolja a gombot a k\u00e9sz\u00fcl\u00e9ken", // EN: Locks the button on the device
    "Cihaza ula\u015f\u0131lamad\u0131 \u2014 ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131nda m\u0131?": "Nem siker\u00fclt el\u00e9rni az eszk\u00f6zt \u2013 ugyanazon a Wi-Fi h\u00e1l\u00f3zaton van?", // EN: Couldn't reach the device — is it on the same Wi-Fi network?
