    "Masa\u00fcst\u00fc Uygulamas\u0131": "Asztali alkalmaz\u00e1s", // EN: Desktop App
    "S\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcle, yeni s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc buradan kontrol et ve y\u00fckle.": "Tekintse meg a verzi\u00f3t, keressen \u00faj verzi\u00f3t itt, \u00e9s telep\u00edtse.", // EN: View the version, check for a new version here and install it.
    "G\u00fcncellemeleri Kontrol Et": "Ellen\u0151rizze a friss\u00edt\u00e9seket", // EN: Check for Updates
    "Yeniden Ba\u015flat ve Y\u00fckle": "Ind\u00edtsa \u00fajra \u00e9s telep\u00edtse", // EN: Restart and Install
    "Cihazlar\u0131n durumu de\u011fi\u015fti\u011finde di\u011fer senaryolar\u0131 otomatik olarak tetikleyin.": "M\u00e1s forgat\u00f3k\u00f6nyvek automatikus aktiv\u00e1l\u00e1sa, amikor eszk\u00f6zei \u00e1llapota megv\u00e1ltozik.", // EN: Trigger other scenarios automatically when your devices' status changes.
    "Cihazlar\u0131na dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edin, stratejilerle otomatik tasarruf et.": "Szerezzen betekint\u00e9st eszk\u00f6zeire, \u00e9s strat\u00e9gi\u00e1kkal automatikusan mentse.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and save automatically with strategies.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 otomatik tarama, QR kod, kurulum kodu ya da manuel katalog ile ekleyebilirsin.": "Hozz\u00e1adhatja eszk\u00f6zeit automatikus szkennel\u00e9ssel, QR-k\u00f3ddal, be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si k\u00f3ddal vagy a k\u00e9zi katal\u00f3gussal.", // EN: You can add your devices with automatic scan, QR code, setup code or the manual catalog.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131za dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edinin ve enerji ipu\u00e7lar\u0131 al\u0131n.": "Szerezzen betekint\u00e9st az eszk\u00f6zeibe \u00e9s kapjon energia tippeket.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and energy tips.
    "Cihaz\u0131 Do\u011frula": "Eszk\u00f6z ellen\u0151rz\u00e9se", // EN: Verify Device
    "Cihaz\u0131 Se\u00e7": "V\u00e1lassza az Eszk\u00f6z lehet\u0151s\u00e9get", // EN: Select Device
    "Cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r": "T\u00e1vol\u00edtsa el az eszk\u00f6zt", // EN: Remove device
    "Cihaz\u0131m neden \u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor?": "Mi\u00e9rt jelenik meg az eszk\u00f6z\u00f6m offline \u00e1llapotban?", // EN: Why does my device show as offline?
    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "\u00cdrja be az eszk\u00f6z IP-c\u00edm\u00e9t, \u00e9s a NEXUS kital\u00e1lja, melyik protokollt besz\u00e9li.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Ellen\u0151rizze az eszk\u00f6z Wi-Fi kapcsolat\u00e1t \u00e9s az \u00fatv\u00e1laszt\u00f3t.Ha a probl\u00e9ma tov\u00e1bbra is fenn\u00e1ll, t\u00e1vol\u00edtsa el az eszk\u00f6zt, \u00e9s adja hozz\u00e1 \u00fajra.L\u00e9p\u00e9sek: Eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k > v\u00e1lassza ki az eszk\u00f6zt > Elt\u00e1vol\u00edt\u00e1s.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Ellen\u0151rizze az eszk\u00f6z Wi-Fi kapcsolat\u00e1t \u00e9s az \u00fatv\u00e1laszt\u00f3t.Ha a probl\u00e9ma tov\u00e1bbra is fenn\u00e1ll, t\u00e1vol\u00edtsa el az eszk\u00f6zt a NEXUS alkalmaz\u00e1sb\u00f3l, \u00e9s adja hozz\u00e1 \u00fajra.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Ha eszk\u00f6ze nem jelenik meg, haszn\u00e1lja a QR-keres\u00e9st vagy a be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si k\u00f3dot.T\u00e1mogat\u00e1s\u00e9rt \u00e9s \u00fatmutat\u00e1s\u00e9rt megnyithatja a s\u00fag\u00f3oldalt.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Az eszk\u00f6z helymeghat\u00e1roz\u00f3 (GPS) szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1sa ki van kapcsolva.Kapcsolja be, \u00e9s pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja \u00fajra.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "Eszk\u00f6ze nem t\u00e1mogatja a helymeghat\u00e1roz\u00e1si szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1sokat.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
    "Cihaz\u0131n listede yok mu? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Az eszk\u00f6z nem szerepel a list\u00e1n?Visszajelz\u00e9s k\u00fcld\u00e9se", // EN: Device not on the list? Send feedback
    "Cihaz\u0131n yerel anahtar\u0131 gerekir \u2014 yak\u0131nda": "Sz\u00fcks\u00e9ge van az eszk\u00f6z helyi kulcs\u00e1ra \u2013 hamarosan", // EN: Needs the device's local key — coming soon
    "Cihaz\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n \u00fczerindeki 8 haneli kodu girin.": "\u00cdrja be a 8 sz\u00e1mjegy\u0171 k\u00f3dot az eszk\u00f6z\u00f6n.", // EN: Enter the 8-digit code on your device.
