    "Evde a\u00e7\u0131k kalan t\u00fcm ayd\u0131nlatma gruplar\u0131n\u0131 kapat.": "Kapcsolja ki az \u00f6sszes otthon hagyott vil\u00e1g\u00edt\u00e1si csoportot.", // EN: Turn off all lighting groups left on at home.
    "Evde ve D\u0131\u015far\u0131da": "Otthon \u00e9s Idegenben", // EN: At Home and Away
    "Evde yok": "El", // EN: Away
    "Evde yokken": "Amikor t\u00e1vol van", // EN: When away
    "Evdeki ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 tek bir ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7inde y\u00f6net. A\u00e7 kapa, parlakl\u0131k, renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahne k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ayn\u0131 uygulamada toplans\u0131n.": "Kezelje otthona vil\u00e1g\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1t szob\u00e1nk\u00e9nt egy folyamatban.Be/ki, f\u00e9nyer\u0151, sz\u00ednh\u0151m\u00e9rs\u00e9klet \u00e9s gyors jelenet parancsikonok egy alkalmaz\u00e1sban.", // EN: Manage the lights in your home room by room in one flow. On/off, brightness, color temperature and quick scene shortcuts in one app.
    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "Adjon k\u00e9sz parancsokat, gyors automatiz\u00e1l\u00e1sokat \u00e9s intelligens alkalmaz\u00e1sjavaslatokat az otthoni eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k alapj\u00e1n.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
    "Evdeki klima ve termostatlar\u0131 tek panelde y\u00f6neten bir iklim konfor uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 mod se\u00e7enekleri, eko modu ve oda bazl\u0131 kontrol aksiyonlar\u0131 olsun.": "Hozzon l\u00e9tre egy kl\u00edmakomfort-alkalmaz\u00e1st, amely egyetlen panelr\u0151l kezeli az otthoni kl\u00edmaberendez\u00e9seket \u00e9s termoszt\u00e1tokat.Tartalmazza a h\u0151m\u00e9rs\u00e9klet-szab\u00e1lyoz\u00e1st, a gyors \u00fczemm\u00f3dokat, az \u00f6ko m\u00f3dot \u00e9s a szoba alap\u00fa m\u0171veleteket.", // EN: Create a climate comfort app that manages the ACs and thermostats in your home from one panel. Include temperature control, quick modes, eco mode and room-based actions.
    "Evimdeki cihazlar\u0131n durumu nedir?": "Mi a k\u00e9sz\u00fcl\u00e9keim \u00e1llapota?", // EN: What is the status of my devices?
    "Evden Uzakta": "T\u00e1vol az otthont\u00f3l", // EN: Away from Home
    "Evden Uzakta Senaryosu": "T\u00e1vol az otthoni jelenett\u0151l", // EN: Away from Home Scene
    "Evden ayr\u0131l\u0131rken enerji ve g\u00fcvenlik kontrollerini toparlar.": "Befejezi az energia- \u00e9s biztons\u00e1gi ellen\u0151rz\u00e9seket, amikor elhagyja otthon\u00e1t.", // EN: Wraps up energy and security checks when you leave home.
    "Evden uzakta": "T\u00e1vol otthonr\u00f3l", // EN: Away from home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f": "Otthon elhagy\u00e1sa", // EN: Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Kontrol\u00fc": "Ellen\u0151rz\u00e9s otthonr\u00f3l", // EN: Leaving Home Check
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Senaryosu": "Otthoni jelenet elhagy\u00e1sa", // EN: Leaving Home Scene
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f \u00d6zeti": "Otthon elhagy\u00e1sa \u00d6sszefoglal\u00f3", // EN: Leaving Home Summary
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Tamamla": "Fejezd be az otthon elhagy\u00e1s\u00e1t", // EN: Finish Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Hozzon l\u00e9tre egy otthonr\u00f3l val\u00f3 t\u00e1voz\u00e1st ellen\u0151rz\u0151 alkalmaz\u00e1st, amely egyetlen k\u00e9perny\u0151n jelen\u00edti meg a bekapcsolt eszk\u00f6z\u00f6ket, a z\u00e1r \u00e1llapot\u00e1t \u00e9s az energiabe\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sokat.Gyors kikapcsol\u00f3 \u00e9s biztons\u00e1gi aktiv\u00e1l\u00f3 gombok hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "Egy menetben ellen\u0151rizze a bekapcsolva hagyott eszk\u00f6z\u00f6ket, a z\u00e1rakat \u00e9s az energia\u00e1llapotot, amikor elhagyja otthon\u00e1t.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "Ha elhagyja otthon\u00e1t, egy k\u00e9perny\u0151n jelen\u00edtse meg a bekapcsolva hagyott eszk\u00f6z\u00f6ket, a z\u00e1rakat \u00e9s az energia\u00e1llapotot.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "Tekintse meg az otthonr\u00f3l indul\u00e1s el\u0151tt bekapcsolva hagyott l\u00e1mp\u00e1kat, csatlakoz\u00f3kat, AC-kat \u00e9s biztons\u00e1gi be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sokat egy panelen.Gy\u0171jtsd \u00f6ssze egy folyamatba a gyors kikapcsol\u00e1s \u00e9s a biztons\u00e1gi aktiv\u00e1l\u00e1s l\u00e9p\u00e9seit.", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "Indul\u00e1s el\u0151tt v\u00e9gezz\u00fck el az utols\u00f3 ellen\u0151rz\u00e9seket.", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "T\u00e1voz\u00e1s ut\u00e1n automatikusan lekapcsolja a vil\u00e1g\u00edt\u00e1st...", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat": "Ha elhagyja otthon\u00e1t, kapcsolja le automatikusan a villanyt", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "Indul\u00e1s ut\u00e1n kapcsolja le automatikusan a l\u00e1mp\u00e1kat, \u00e9s kapcsolja fel, amikor visszat\u00e9r.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
    "Evde kimse yokken klimay\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n, gereksiz t\u00fcketimi \u00f6nleyin.": "Kapcsolja ki automatikusan a l\u00e9gkondicion\u00e1l\u00f3t, ha senki nincs otthon, \u00e9s ker\u00fclje a felesleges fogyaszt\u00e1st.", // EN: Turn off the air conditioner automatically when nobody is home and avoid needless consumption.
    "Gece belirledi\u011fin saatte bekleme modundaki cihazlar\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc otomatik olarak kesin.": "A k\u00e9szenl\u00e9ti \u00e1llapotban l\u00e9v\u0151 k\u00e9sz\u00fcl\u00e9kek \u00e1ramell\u00e1t\u00e1s\u00e1nak automatikus le\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sa a v\u00e1lasztott id\u0151pontban \u00e9jszaka.", // EN: Automatically cut power to devices on standby at the time you choose at night.
