    "Eve geldim": "Isten hozott itthon", // EN: Welcome home
    "Eve vard\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya evden ayr\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Ha haza\u00e9rkezik vagy elmegy", // EN: When you arrive home or leave
    "Eve yakla\u015f\u0131rken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 a\u00e7, klimay\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r ve garaj kap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 arac\u0131n\u0131n ekran\u0131ndan kontrol et.": "Kapcsolja fel a l\u00e1mp\u00e1kat, ind\u00edtsa el a kl\u00edmaberendez\u00e9st, \u00e9s ir\u00e1ny\u00edtsa a gar\u00e1zsajt\u00f3t az aut\u00f3 k\u00e9perny\u0151j\u00e9r\u0151l, amint hazafel\u00e9 k\u00f6zeledik.", // EN: Turn on the lights, start the AC and control the garage door from your car's screen as you approach home.
    "Evet, Uygula": "Igen, Jelentkez\u00e9s", // EN: Yes, Apply
    "Evet, \u0130ptal Et": "Igen, M\u00e9gse", // EN: Yes, Cancel
    "Evet. NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "Igen.A NEXUS els\u0151sorban helyi;eszk\u00f6zadatai ezen az eszk\u00f6z\u00f6n maradnak, \u00e9s nem osztj\u00e1k meg harmadik felekkel.", // EN: Yes. NEXUS is local-first; your device data stays on this device and isn't shared with third parties.
