    "Bu hafta kayda de\u011fer bir etkinlik yok. Senaryo \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmalar\u0131 ve uyar\u0131lar burada toplan\u0131r.": "Ezen a h\u00e9ten nincs figyelemre m\u00e9lt\u00f3 tev\u00e9kenys\u00e9g.A helysz\u00ednel\u00e9s \u00e9s a riaszt\u00e1sok itt gy\u0171lnek \u00f6ssze.", // EN: No notable activity this week. Scene runs and alerts gather here.
    "Al\u0131\u015fveri\u015f listesi, ev i\u015fleri ya da k\u0131sa notlar \u2014 ailenle payla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n ilk maddeyi ekle.": "Bev\u00e1s\u00e1rl\u00f3lista, h\u00e1zimunk\u00e1k vagy gyors jegyzetek \u2013 adja hozz\u00e1 az els\u0151 term\u00e9ket, amelyet megoszthat csal\u00e1dj\u00e1val.", // EN: Shopping list, chores or quick notes — add the first item to share with your family.
    "Ev Panosu evin \u00fcyeleri aras\u0131ndad\u0131r. Ev Y\u00f6netimi'nden ev olu\u015ftur ya da davetle kat\u0131l.": "A t\u00e1bla az otthonod tagjai\u00e9.Hozzon l\u00e9tre otthont az Otthonkezel\u00e9sb\u0151l, vagy csatlakozzon megh\u00edv\u00e1ssal.", // EN: The board belongs to your home's members. Create a home from Home Management or join by invite.
    "Bu madde panodan t\u00fcm \u00fcyeler i\u00e7in kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r.": "Ezt a t\u00e9telt minden tag eset\u00e9ben elt\u00e1vol\u00edtj\u00e1k a test\u00fcletb\u0151l.", // EN: This item is removed from the board for all members.
    "Pano \u015fu an kapal\u0131.": "A t\u00e1bla jelenleg nem el\u00e9rhet\u0151.", // EN: The board is unavailable right now.
    "Ev Panosu i\u00e7in oturum a\u00e7mal\u0131s\u0131n.": "Jelentkezzen be a Home Board haszn\u00e1lat\u00e1hoz.", // EN: Sign in to use the Home Board.
    "Ev Panosu bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "A Home Board nem \u00e9rhet\u0151 el ebben a buildben.", // EN: Home Board is unavailable in this build.
