    "Gece i\u00e7in \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, bildirimleri ve g\u00fcvenlik ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 d\u00fczenler.": "Elrendezi a f\u00e9nyeket, az \u00e9rtes\u00edt\u00e9seket \u00e9s a biztons\u00e1gi l\u00e9p\u00e9seket az \u00e9jszak\u00e1ra.", // EN: Arranges lights, notifications and security steps for the night.
