    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 y\u00f6netmek ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahneler kurmak i\u00e7in haz\u0131r ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerisini a\u00e7\u0131n.": "Nyissa meg a k\u00e9sz intelligens alkalmaz\u00e1st, hogy szob\u00e1nk\u00e9nt kezelje a vil\u00e1g\u00edt\u00e1st, \u00e9s \u00e1ll\u00edtson be gyors jeleneteket.", // EN: Open the ready-made smart app to manage lights room by room and set up quick scenes.
