    "Kamera, kilit ve sens\u00f6rleri ayn\u0131 ekranda g\u00f6r. Evdeyim ve d\u0131\u015far\u0131day\u0131m modlar\u0131, kritik durum \u00f6zetleri ve h\u0131zl\u0131 g\u00fcvenlik aksiyonlar\u0131 tek yerde toplans\u0131n.": "Tekintse meg a kamer\u00e1kat, z\u00e1rakat \u00e9s \u00e9rz\u00e9kel\u0151ket ugyanazon a k\u00e9perny\u0151n.Otthoni \u00e9s t\u00e1voll\u00e9ti m\u00f3dok, kritikus \u00e1llapot-\u00f6sszefoglal\u00f3k \u00e9s gyors biztons\u00e1gi int\u00e9zked\u00e9sek egy helyen.", // EN: See cameras, locks and sensors on the same screen. At-home and away modes, critical status summaries and quick security actions in one place.
    "Kamera, kilit ve sens\u00f6rleri tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir ev g\u00fcvenlik merkezi olu\u015ftur. Evdeyim ve d\u0131\u015far\u0131day\u0131m modlar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 kontrol butonlar\u0131 ve kritik durum \u00f6zetleri ekle.": "Hozzon l\u00e9tre egy otthoni biztons\u00e1gi k\u00f6zpontot, amely egyetlen k\u00e9perny\u0151n jelen\u00edti meg a kamer\u00e1kat, z\u00e1rakat \u00e9s \u00e9rz\u00e9kel\u0151ket.Adjon hozz\u00e1 otthoni \u00e9s t\u00e1voll\u00e9ti m\u00f3dokat, gyorsvez\u00e9rl\u0151 gombokat \u00e9s kritikus \u00e1llapot-\u00f6sszefoglal\u00f3kat.", // EN: Create a home security center that shows cameras, locks and sensors on one screen. Add at-home and away modes, quick control buttons and critical status summaries.
