    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcdeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, sonra tekrar dene.": "Nyomja meg a kerek gombot a h\u00eddon, majd pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja \u00fajra.", // EN: Press the round button on the bridge, then try again.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcn\u00fcn \u00fcst\u00fcndeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, ard\u0131ndan 30 saniye i\u00e7inde \u201cK\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc ba\u011fla\u201dya dokun.": "Nyomja meg a kerek gombot a h\u00edd tetej\u00e9n, majd 30 m\u00e1sodpercen bel\u00fcl \u00e9rintse meg a \u201eH\u00edd csatlakoztat\u00e1sa\u201d lehet\u0151s\u00e9get.", // EN: Press the round button on top of the bridge, then tap “Connect bridge” within 30 seconds.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol ve tekrar dene.": "Nem siker\u00fclt csatlakozni a h\u00eddhoz.Gy\u0151z\u0151dj\u00f6n meg arr\u00f3l, hogy ugyanazon a h\u00e1l\u00f3zaton van, \u00e9s pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja \u00fajra.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the bridge. Make sure you're on the same network and try again.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011fl\u0131 lamba bulunamad\u0131.": "A h\u00eddhoz kapcsol\u00f3d\u00f3 l\u00e1mp\u00e1kat nem tal\u00e1lt\u00e1k.", // EN: No lamps connected to the bridge were found.
