    "L\u00fctfen cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131nda oldu\u011fundan emin olun.": "Gy\u0151z\u0151dj\u00f6n meg arr\u00f3l, hogy az eszk\u00f6z be van kapcsolva, \u00e9s ugyanahhoz a Wi-Fi h\u00e1l\u00f3zathoz csatlakozik.", // EN: Please make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi network.
    "L\u00fctfen cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin olun.": "Gy\u0151z\u0151dj\u00f6n meg arr\u00f3l, hogy az eszk\u00f6z p\u00e1ros\u00edt\u00e1si m\u00f3dban van.", // EN: Please make sure the device is in pairing mode.
