    "Matter cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 eklemek i\u00e7in bir Matter denetleyicisi gerekir; NEXUS bu deste\u011fi hen\u00fcz sunmuyor. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011flan\u0131yorsa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle ekleyebilirsin.": "A Matter eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1s\u00e1hoz Matter vez\u00e9rl\u0151re van sz\u00fcks\u00e9g, amelyet a NEXUS m\u00e9g nem k\u00edn\u00e1l.Ha az eszk\u00f6z Wi-Fi-n kereszt\u00fcl csatlakozik, hozz\u00e1adhatja azt a helyi h\u00e1l\u00f3zatr\u00f3l az IP-c\u00edme alapj\u00e1n.", // EN: Adding Matter devices needs a Matter controller, which NEXUS doesn't offer yet. If the device connects over Wi-Fi, you can add it from your local network by its IP address.
