    "NEXUS AI ak\u0131ll\u0131 ev kontrol\u00fc": "NEXUS AI intelligens otthoni vez\u00e9rl\u00e9s", // EN: NEXUS AI smart home control
    "NEXUS AI al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 \u00f6\u011frenir ve evinizi size \u00f6zel m\u00fckemmel bir ya\u015fam alan\u0131na d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr\u00fcr.": "A NEXUS AI megtanulja az \u00d6n szok\u00e1sait, \u00e9s otthon\u00e1t olyan \u00e9lett\u00e9rr\u00e9 var\u00e1zsolja, amelyet csak \u00d6n sz\u00e1m\u00e1ra k\u00e9sz\u00edtettek.", // EN: NEXUS AI learns your habits and turns your home into a living space made just for you.
    "NEXUS AI ile her \u015feyi olu\u015fturun": "K\u00e9sz\u00edtsen b\u00e1rmit a NEXUS AI seg\u00edts\u00e9g\u00e9vel", // EN: Create anything with NEXUS AI
    "NEXUS AI ile sohbet et": "Cseveg\u00e9s a NEXUS AI-val", // EN: Chat with NEXUS AI
    "NEXUS AI ile yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z her g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fme puan kullan\u0131r. Puanlar her g\u00fcn yenilenir.": "Minden NEXUS AI-val folytatott besz\u00e9lget\u00e9s pontokat haszn\u00e1l.A pontok minden nap meg\u00fajulnak.", // EN: Each conversation with NEXUS AI uses points. Points renew every day.
    "NEXUS AI puanlar\u0131 nedir?": "Mik azok a NEXUS AI-pontok?", // EN: What are NEXUS AI points?
    "NEXUS AI puanlar\u0131n her g\u00fcn yenilenir; \u015fu an t\u00fcm \u00f6zellikler \u00fccretsiz.": "NEXUS AI-pontjai minden nap meg\u00fajulnak;most minden funkci\u00f3 ingyenes.", // EN: Your NEXUS AI points renew every day; every feature is free right now.
    "NEXUS AI'a sor": "K\u00e9rdezd meg a NEXUS AI-t", // EN: Ask NEXUS AI
