    "NEXUS Haz\u0131r": "NEXUS k\u00e9sz", // EN: NEXUS Ready
    "NEXUS HomeKit K\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc": "NEXUS HomeKit Bridge", // EN: NEXUS HomeKit Bridge
    "NEXUS Y\u00f6nlendiriliyor...": "\u00c1tir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00e1s a NEXUS-ra...", // EN: Redirecting to NEXUS...
    "NEXUS i\u00e7inde \"Bir Eve Kat\u0131l\" alan\u0131na bu kodu girerek kat\u0131labilirsin.": "\u00dagy csatlakozhat, hogy be\u00edrja ezt a k\u00f3dot a NEXUS \u201eCsatlakoz\u00e1s otthonhoz\u201d r\u00e9sz\u00e9ben.", // EN: You can join by entering this code in "Join a Home" inside NEXUS.
    "NEXUS senaryolar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 Siri komutlar\u0131yla saniyeler i\u00e7inde sesle \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.": "Futtassa NEXUS-forgat\u00f3k\u00f6nyveit hanggal a Siri seg\u00edts\u00e9g\u00e9vel m\u00e1sodpercek alatt.", // EN: Run your NEXUS scenarios by voice with Siri in seconds.
    "NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r, cihaz komutlar\u0131 do\u011frudan yerel a\u011fdan gider ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "A NEXUS els\u0151sorban helyi: az eszk\u00f6z adatai ezen az eszk\u00f6z\u00f6n maradnak, az eszk\u00f6zparancsok k\u00f6zvetlen\u00fcl a helyi h\u00e1l\u00f3zaton kereszt\u00fcl mennek \u00e1t, \u00e9s semmit nem osztanak meg harmadik felekkel.", // EN: NEXUS is local-first: your device data stays on this device, device commands go straight over your local network, and nothing is shared with third parties.
