    "NEXUS \u2014 \u00dc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc Taraf Cihaz ve Hizmetler": "NEXUS \u2013 Harmadik f\u00e9lt\u0151l sz\u00e1rmaz\u00f3 eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k \u00e9s szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1sok", // EN: NEXUS — Third-Party Devices and Services
    "NEXUS'u di\u011fer platformlara ba\u011flayarak cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 her yerden kontrol et.": "Csatlakoztassa a NEXUS-t m\u00e1s platformokhoz, hogy b\u00e1rhonnan ir\u00e1ny\u00edthassa eszk\u00f6zeit.", // EN: Connect NEXUS to other platforms to control your devices from anywhere.
    "Bu hizmet ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 hen\u00fcz kullan\u0131labilir de\u011fil. \u00dc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraf cihazlar i\u00e7in Entegrasyonlar'dan Home Assistant'\u0131 kullanabilirsin.": "Ezek a szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1si kapcsolatok m\u00e9g nem \u00e9rhet\u0151k el.Harmadik f\u00e9lt\u0151l sz\u00e1rmaz\u00f3 eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k eset\u00e9n haszn\u00e1lhatja az Integrations Home Assistant funkci\u00f3j\u00e1t.", // EN: These service connections are not available yet. For third-party devices, you can use Home Assistant from Integrations.
