    "NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fi iptal edildi": "A NEXUS+ el\u0151fizet\u00e9s lemondva", // EN: NEXUS+ subscription cancelled
    "NEXUS+ hen\u00fcz sat\u0131\u015fta de\u011fil. Cihaz ekleme, kontrol panelleri, senaryolar ve NEXUS AI \u015fu an tamamen \u00fccretsiz; abonelik a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda buradan haber verece\u011fiz.": "A NEXUS+ m\u00e9g nem kaphat\u00f3.Az eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k, forgat\u00f3k\u00f6nyvek \u00e9s NEXUS AI hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa jelenleg teljesen ingyenes;itt \u00e9rtes\u00edtj\u00fck, ha megny\u00edlik az el\u0151fizet\u00e9s.", // EN: NEXUS+ isn't on sale yet. Adding devices, scenarios and NEXUS AI are completely free right now; we'll let you know here when subscriptions open.
    "NEXUS+ yak\u0131nda": "A NEXUS+ hamarosan \u00e9rkezik", // EN: NEXUS+ coming soon
    "NEXUS, \u00e7er\u00e7eve i\u00e7indeki kodu otomatik alg\u0131lar ve e\u015fle\u015fmeyi ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "A NEXUS automatikusan felismeri a keretben l\u00e9v\u0151 k\u00f3dot, \u00e9s megkezdi a p\u00e1ros\u00edt\u00e1st.", // EN: NEXUS detects the code inside the frame automatically and starts pairing.
