    "Pi\u015firme sonras\u0131 karbonmonoksit seviyesi hafif y\u00fckselmi\u015f. Pencereyi a\u00e7man\u0131z \u00f6nerilir.": "F\u0151z\u00e9s ut\u00e1n a sz\u00e9n-monoxid enyh\u00e9n emelkedett.Az ablak kinyit\u00e1sa javasolt.", // EN: Carbon monoxide rose slightly after cooking. Opening a window is recommended.
