    "TV / Bilgisayar": "TV / sz\u00e1m\u00edt\u00f3g\u00e9p", // EN: TV / Computer
    "LED \u015eerit / I\u015f\u0131k Paneli": "LED szalag / f\u00e9ny panel", // EN: LED Strip / Light Panel
    "Uyand\u0131rma cihaz\u0131 olarak ekle": "Hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1s \u00e9breszt\u0151eszk\u00f6zk\u00e9nt", // EN: Add as a wake-up device
    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "Ezen a c\u00edmen van egy eszk\u00f6z, de az nem besz\u00e9l NEXUS protokollt.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
    "Bu cihaz zaten ekli.": "Ez az eszk\u00f6z m\u00e1r hozz\u00e1adva.", // EN: This device is already added.
    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "P\u00e1ros\u00edtsd \u00e9s add hozz\u00e1", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "A p\u00e1ros\u00edt\u00e1si k\u00f3d nem \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes.\u00cdrja be a 11 sz\u00e1mjegy\u0171 k\u00f3dot vagy az MT: karakterekkel kezd\u0151d\u0151 QR-tartalmat.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "\u00cdrja be ezt a k\u00f3dot a NEXUS asztali alkalmaz\u00e1sban.Ha az eszk\u00f6z Wi-Fi-n van, akkor a helyi h\u00e1l\u00f3zatr\u00f3l is hozz\u00e1adhatja az IP-c\u00edme alapj\u00e1n.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Az eszk\u00f6zt ugyanazon a h\u00e1l\u00f3zaton keresik, \u00e9s p\u00e1ros\u00edtj\u00e1k.Ez ak\u00e1r egy percig is eltarthat;a k\u00e9sz\u00fcl\u00e9knek bekapcsoltnak \u00e9s p\u00e1ros\u00edt\u00e1si m\u00f3dban kell lennie.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Az eszk\u00f6z nem tal\u00e1lhat\u00f3, vagy nem p\u00e1ros\u00edthat\u00f3.Gy\u0151z\u0151dj\u00f6n meg arr\u00f3l, hogy ugyanazon a h\u00e1l\u00f3zaton van, be van kapcsolva \u00e9s p\u00e1ros\u00edt\u00e1si m\u00f3dban van.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Az eszk\u00f6z nem tal\u00e1lhat\u00f3.Gy\u0151z\u0151dj\u00f6n meg arr\u00f3l, hogy ugyanazon a h\u00e1l\u00f3zaton van, be van kapcsolva \u00e9s p\u00e1ros\u00edt\u00e1si m\u00f3dban van.El\u0151fordulhat, hogy sz\u00e1m\u00edt\u00f3g\u00e9p\u00e9nek t\u0171zfala blokkolja a helyi h\u00e1l\u00f3zaton l\u00e9v\u0151 eszk\u00f6z\u00f6kt\u0151l \u00e9rkez\u0151 v\u00e1laszokat.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Az eszk\u00f6zt nem lehetett p\u00e1ros\u00edtani.Ellen\u0151rizze a p\u00e1ros\u00edt\u00e1si k\u00f3dot \u00e9s azt, hogy a k\u00e9sz\u00fcl\u00e9k p\u00e1ros\u00edt\u00e1si m\u00f3dban van-e.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Az eszk\u00f6z p\u00e1ros\u00edtva van, de nincs olyan funkci\u00f3ja, amelyet a NEXUS tud vez\u00e9relni.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "A k\u00e9sz\u00fcl\u00e9k nem reag\u00e1lt.Gy\u0151z\u0151dj\u00f6n meg arr\u00f3l, hogy be van kapcsolva \u00e9s ugyanabban a h\u00e1l\u00f3zatban van.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
