    "QR kodunu \u00e7er\u00e7evenin i\u00e7ine hizalay\u0131n.": "Igaz\u00edtsa a QR-k\u00f3dot a keretbe.", // EN: Align the QR code inside the frame.
    "QR okunamazsa, a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki manuel ekleme se\u00e7ene\u011fiyle kodu elle girin.": "Ha a QR-k\u00f3d nem olvashat\u00f3, \u00edrja be k\u00e9zzel a k\u00f3dot az al\u00e1bbi manu\u00e1lis opci\u00f3val.", // EN: If the QR can't be read, enter the code manually with the manual option below.
    "QR tarama, kurulum kodu ve manuel katalog ile cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 ger\u00e7ek ak\u0131\u015f \u00fczerinden ekleyebilirsin.": "Eszk\u00f6zeit automatikus szkennel\u00e9ssel, QR-k\u00f3ddal, be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si k\u00f3ddal vagy a k\u00e9zi katal\u00f3gussal adhatja hozz\u00e1.", // EN: You can add your devices by automatic scan, QR code, setup code or the manual catalog.
