    "TV odas\u0131 i\u00e7in k\u0131s\u0131k parlakl\u0131kta sinema sahnesi olu\u015ftur.": "Create a dimmed cinema scene for the TV room.", // EN: Create a dimmed cinema scene for the TV room.
    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in bir sinema modu uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. Film ba\u015flat, ses seviyesi, ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan gece e\u011flence k\u0131sayollar\u0131 olsun.": "Hozzon l\u00e9tre egy mozi m\u00f3d alkalmaz\u00e1st t\u00e9v\u00e9khez \u00e9s m\u00e9diaeszk\u00f6z\u00f6kh\u00f6z.Tartalmazza a film ind\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1t, a hanger\u0151t, a k\u00f6rnyezeti f\u00e9nyeket \u00e9s a zavar\u00f3 esti sz\u00f3rakoztat\u00f3 parancsikonokat.", // EN: Create a cinema mode app for TVs and media devices. Include start movie, volume, ambient lights and distraction-free evening entertainment shortcuts.
    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in tek dokunu\u015flu e\u011flence paneli.": "Egy\u00e9rint\u00e9ses sz\u00f3rakoztat\u00f3 panel TV-khez \u00e9s m\u00e9diaeszk\u00f6z\u00f6kh\u00f6z.", // EN: One-tap entertainment panel for TVs and media devices.
    "TV, hoparl\u00f6r ve e\u011flence cihazlar\u0131": "TVs, speakers and entertainment devices", // EN: TVs, speakers and entertainment devices
    "TV, medya kutusu ve ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 tek aksiyonda birle\u015ftir. Film ba\u015flat, gece modu ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan e\u011flence sahneleri kolayca kurulabilsin.": "Egyes\u00edtse a TV-t, a m\u00e9diaboxot \u00e9s a k\u00f6rnyezeti f\u00e9nyeket egy m\u0171veletben.K\u00f6nny\u00edtse meg a filmind\u00edt\u00e1st, az \u00e9jszakai m\u00f3dot \u00e9s a figyelemelterel\u00e9st\u0151l mentes sz\u00f3rakoztat\u00f3 jelenetek be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1t.", // EN: Combine the TV, media box and ambient lights in one action. Make it easy to set up start movie, night mode and distraction-free entertainment scenes.
    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "Term\u00e9szetesen!\u00d6ssze tudok \u00e1ll\u00edtani neked egy nagyszer\u0171 okos forgat\u00f3k\u00f6nyvet.Could you give me a few details?P\u00e9ld\u00e1ul: \u201eInd\u00edtsa el a k\u00e1v\u00e9f\u0151z\u0151t, ha fel\u00e9bredek\u201d vagy \u201eFolom le teljesen a l\u00e1mp\u00e1kat, ha filmet n\u00e9zek\u201d.", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
