    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrge ve temizlik cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in g\u00fcn ve oda plan\u0131.": "Nap- \u00e9s szobatervek robotporsz\u00edv\u00f3khoz \u00e9s tiszt\u00edt\u00f3eszk\u00f6z\u00f6kh\u00f6z.", // EN: Day and room plans for robot vacuums and cleaning devices.
    "Sulama saatleri, b\u00f6lgeler ve sens\u00f6r verisiyle ak\u0131ll\u0131 plan.": "Intelligens \u00f6nt\u00f6z\u00e9si \u00fctemez\u00e9sek, z\u00f3n\u00e1k \u00e9s szenzorvez\u00e9relt tervez\u00e9s.", // EN: Smart watering schedules, zones and sensor-driven planning.
    "Sens\u00f6r verisiyle havaland\u0131rma ve temizleyiciyi otomatik y\u00f6net.": "Kezelje a szell\u0151ztet\u00e9st \u00e9s a tiszt\u00edt\u00f3berendez\u00e9seket automatikusan az \u00e9rz\u00e9kel\u0151adatokb\u00f3l.", // EN: Manage ventilation and purifiers automatically from sensor data.
    "\u00c7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rken sessizlik, do\u011fru \u0131\u015f\u0131k ve bildirim aras\u0131.": "Csendes, megfelel\u0151 vil\u00e1g\u00edt\u00e1s \u00e9s nincs megszak\u00edt\u00e1s munka k\u00f6zben.", // EN: Quiet, proper lighting and no interruptions while you work.
    "Uzaktan Kumanda": "T\u00e1vir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00f3", // EN: Remote Control
    "Uzaktayken evi korumak i\u00e7in kameralar\u0131 etkinle\u015ftir": "Kapcsolja be a kamer\u00e1kat, hogy megv\u00e9dje otthon\u00e1t, am\u00edg t\u00e1vol van", // EN: Turn on cameras to protect your home while you're away
    "Uzun komutlar i\u00e7in klavyeyle rahat yaz\u0131m": "K\u00e9nyelmes g\u00e9pel\u00e9s billenty\u0171zeten a hossz\u00fa parancsokhoz", // EN: Comfortable typing on a keyboard for long commands
    "U\u00e7ucu Organik Bile\u015fik (VOC) Alarm\u0131": "Ill\u00e9kony szerves vegy\u00fclet (VOC) riaszt\u00e1s", // EN: Volatile Organic Compound (VOC) Alarm
    "U\u00e7ucu Organik Bile\u015fik (VOC) Alarm\u0131 (Gateway)": "Ill\u00e9kony szerves vegy\u00fclet (VOC) riaszt\u00e1s (\u00e1tj\u00e1r\u00f3)", // EN: Volatile Organic Compound (VOC) Alarm (Gateway)
    "Vakumlu Pi\u015firme Makinesi": "Sous Vide t\u0171zhely", // EN: Sous Vide Cooker
    "Vana Kontrol Ekipmanlar\u0131": "Szelepvez\u00e9rl\u0151 berendez\u00e9sek", // EN: Valve Control Equipment
    "Var\u015fova": "Vars\u00f3", // EN: Warsaw
    "Vazge\u00e7": "M\u00e9gsem", // EN: Cancel
    "Vazge\u00e7 ve Giri\u015fe D\u00f6n": "M\u00e9gse \u00e9s vissza a bejelentkez\u00e9shez", // EN: Cancel and Back to Sign In
    "Veri Paneli": "Adatpanel", // EN: Data Panel
    "Veri al\u0131namad\u0131": "Nem siker\u00fclt lek\u00e9rni az adatokat", // EN: Couldn't get data
    "Veri yok": "Nincs adat", // EN: No data
    "Veriler cihaz\u0131nda kal\u0131r, ayn\u0131 gizlilik korumalar\u0131": "Az adatok az eszk\u00f6z\u00f6n maradnak, ugyanaz az adatv\u00e9delem", // EN: Your data stays on your device, same privacy protections
    "Verilerim g\u00fcvende mi?": "Biztons\u00e1gban vannak az adataim?", // EN: Is my data safe?
    "Veya QR Kodunu Tara": "Vagy olvassa be a QR-k\u00f3dot", // EN: Or Scan the QR Code
