    "\u0130ptal \u015fu an tamamlanamad\u0131. Biraz sonra yeniden dene.": "A t\u00f6rl\u00e9st nem siker\u00fclt befejezni.Pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja \u00fajra egy pillanat m\u00falva.", // EN: Cancellation could not be completed. Try again in a moment.
