    "Cihazlar\u0131ma sor": "K\u00e9rdezd meg a k\u00e9sz\u00fcl\u00e9keimet", // EN: Ask my devices
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131 do\u011fruland\u0131. Hesab\u0131n i\u00e7in yeni bir \u015fifre belirle.": "Link ellen\u0151rizve.\u00c1ll\u00edtson be \u00faj jelsz\u00f3t a fi\u00f3kj\u00e1hoz.", // EN: Link verified. Set a new password for your account.
    "\u015eifreyi Kaydet": "Jelsz\u00f3 ment\u00e9se", // EN: Save Password
    "Google ile giri\u015f \u015fu anda kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor. E-posta ve \u015fifreyle giri\u015f yap; Google ile hesap a\u00e7t\u0131ysan \u201c\u015eifremi Unuttum\u201d ile bir \u015fifre belirleyebilirsin.": "A Google bejelentkez\u00e9s jelenleg nem \u00e9rhet\u0151 el.Jelentkezzen be e-mail c\u00edmmel \u00e9s jelsz\u00f3val;Ha l\u00e9trehozta fi\u00f3kj\u00e1t a Google-n\u00e1l, haszn\u00e1lja az \u201eElfelejtett jelsz\u00f3\u201d lehet\u0151s\u00e9get a jelsz\u00f3 be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1hoz.", // EN: Google sign-in isn't available right now. Sign in with email and password; if you created your account with Google, use “Forgot Password” to set a password.
