    "Yeni s\u00fcr\u00fcm bulununca arka planda hemen indirilsin.": "Amint megtal\u00e1lja, t\u00f6ltse le az \u00faj verzi\u00f3kat a h\u00e1tt\u00e9rben.", // EN: Download new versions in the background as soon as they're found.
    "Home Assistant k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fcd\u00fcr": "a Home Assistant h\u00edd", // EN: the Home Assistant bridge
    "Entegrasyonlar": "Integr\u00e1ci\u00f3k", // EN: Integrations
    "yukar\u0131daki hesap e-postas\u0131n\u0131": "a fi\u00f3k fenti e-mail c\u00edme", // EN: the account email above
    "\u0130ptal ve \u00f6deme y\u00f6ntemi de\u011fi\u015fikli\u011fi g\u00fcvenli \u00f6deme sayfam\u0131z Whop \u00fczerinden yap\u0131l\u0131r. \u0130ptal edersen mevcut d\u00f6nemin sonuna kadar kullanmaya devam edersin ve bir sonraki \u00f6deme al\u0131nmaz.": "A fizet\u00e9si m\u00f3d lemond\u00e1sa \u00e9s m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1sa biztons\u00e1gos fizet\u00e9si oldalunkon, a Whop oldalon t\u00f6rt\u00e9nik.Ha lemondja az el\u0151fizet\u00e9st, tov\u00e1bbra is a NEXUS+-t haszn\u00e1lja az aktu\u00e1lis id\u0151szak v\u00e9g\u00e9ig, \u00e9s a k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 fizet\u00e9st nem veszik fel.", // EN: Cancelling and changing your payment method happen on our secure checkout page, Whop. If you cancel, you keep using NEXUS+ until the end of the current period and the next payment is never taken.
    "Aboneli\u011fin yok. NEXUS+ i\u00e7in Plus sayfas\u0131ndan \u00fccretsiz deneyebilirsin.": "Nincs el\u0151fizet\u00e9sed.Pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja ki ingyenesen a NEXUS+-t a Plusz oldalon.", // EN: You don't have a subscription. Try NEXUS+ free from the Plus page.
    "QR, kurulum kodu veya manuel katalog ile ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "A QR-k\u00f3ddal, be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si k\u00f3ddal vagy a k\u00e9zi katal\u00f3gussal hozz\u00e1adott eszk\u00f6z\u00f6k itt jelennek meg.", // EN: Devices you add by QR, setup code or the manual catalog show up here.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrge kontrol paneli \u00b7 ba\u015flat, durdur, eve d\u00f6n": "Robot porsz\u00edv\u00f3 vez\u00e9rl\u0151panel \u00b7 ind\u00edt\u00e1s, le\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s, hazat\u00e9r\u00e9s", // EN: Robot vacuum control panel · start, stop, return home
    "Kilit kontrol paneli \u00b7 kilitle, a\u00e7": "Vez\u00e9rl\u0151pult z\u00e1rol\u00e1sa \u00b7 lez\u00e1r\u00e1s, felold\u00e1s", // EN: Lock control panel · lock, unlock
    "Alarm kontrol paneli \u00b7 kur, kapat, sirene": "Riaszt\u00f3 k\u00f6zpont \u00b7 \u00e9les\u00edt\u00e9s, hat\u00e1stalan\u00edt\u00e1s, szir\u00e9na", // EN: Alarm control panel · arm, disarm, siren
