    "Ayd\u0131nlatma kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat, parlakl\u0131k": "Vil\u00e1g\u00edt\u00e1s vez\u00e9rl\u0151panel \u00b7 be, ki, f\u00e9nyer\u0151", // EN: Lighting control panel · on, off, brightness
    "Hava kalitesi paneli \u00b7 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm ve uyar\u0131lar": "Leveg\u0151min\u0151s\u00e9g panel \u00b7 leolvas\u00e1sok \u00e9s riaszt\u00e1sok", // EN: Air quality panel · readings and alerts
