    "Sa\u011fl\u0131k ve uyku paneli \u00b7 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm, takip": "Eg\u00e9szs\u00e9g \u00e9s alv\u00e1s panel \u00b7 leolvas\u00e1sok, nyomon k\u00f6vet\u00e9s", // EN: Health and sleep panel · readings, tracking
    "Spor ekipmanlar\u0131 paneli \u00b7 takip, \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm": "Sportfelszerel\u00e9s panel \u00b7 k\u00f6vet\u00e9s, leolvas\u00e1s", // EN: Sports equipment panel · tracking, readings
    "Bah\u00e7e ve sulama kontrol paneli \u00b7 vana, zamanlama": "Kert \u00e9s \u00f6nt\u00f6z\u00e9s vez\u00e9rl\u0151pult \u00b7 szelep, \u00fctemez\u00e9s", // EN: Garden and irrigation control panel · valve, scheduling
    "Medya kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat, ses, kanal": "M\u00e9diavez\u00e9rl\u0151 panel \u00b7 be, ki, hanger\u0151, csatorna", // EN: Media control panel · on, off, volume, channel
