    "L\u00fctfen ge\u00e7erli bir e-posta gir.": "K\u00e9rj\u00fck, adjon meg egy \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes e-mail-c\u00edmet.", // EN: Please enter a valid email.
    "Bu e-posta ile zaten bir hesap var. L\u00fctfen giri\u015f yap\u0131n.": "M\u00e1r l\u00e9tezik fi\u00f3k ezzel az e-mail c\u00edmmel.K\u00e9rj\u00fck, jelentkezzen be.", // EN: An account with this email already exists. Please sign in.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131n s\u00fcresi dolmu\u015f ya da ge\u00e7ersiz. L\u00fctfen yeniden dene.": "Ez a link lej\u00e1rt vagy \u00e9rv\u00e9nytelen.K\u00e9rj\u00fck, pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja \u00fajra.", // EN: This link has expired or is invalid. Please try again.
    "Bulut hesab\u0131 bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde kapal\u0131; yerel hesaplarda \u015fifre s\u0131f\u0131rlanamaz.": "A felh\u0151fi\u00f3k le van tiltva ebben a buildben;a helyi fi\u00f3k jelszavai nem \u00e1ll\u00edthat\u00f3k vissza.", // EN: Cloud account is disabled in this build; local account passwords cannot be reset.
    "Bu adres bir hesaba ba\u011fl\u0131ysa s\u0131f\u0131rlama ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\u00f6nderildi. Gelen kutunu (ve gereksiz klas\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fc) kontrol et.": "Ha ez a c\u00edm egy fi\u00f3khoz van kapcsolva, akkor a rendszer vissza\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si linket k\u00fcld.Ellen\u0151rizze a be\u00e9rkez\u0151 leveleket (\u00e9s a spam mapp\u00e1t).", // EN: If this address is linked to an account, a reset link has been sent. Check your inbox (and spam folder).
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denedin. Bir dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "T\u00fal sok pr\u00f3b\u00e1lkoz\u00e1s.K\u00e9rj\u00fck, pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja \u00fajra egy perc m\u00falva.", // EN: Too many attempts. Please try again in a minute.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131 g\u00f6nderilemedi.": "Nem siker\u00fclt elk\u00fcldeni a linket.", // EN: Could not send the link.
    "Tekrar G\u00f6nder": "K\u00fcldje el \u00fajra", // EN: Send again
    "\u015eifren g\u00fcncellendi. \u015eimdi giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "A jelszava friss\u00edtve lett.Most m\u00e1r bejelentkezhet.", // EN: Your password has been updated. You can sign in now.
    "Mevcut \u015fifreni gir.": "Adja meg jelenlegi jelszav\u00e1t.", // EN: Enter your current password.
    "Mevcut \u015fifre yanl\u0131\u015f.": "A jelenlegi jelsz\u00f3 helytelen.", // EN: Current password is incorrect.
    "Yeni \u015fifre eskisinden farkl\u0131 olmal\u0131.": "Az \u00faj jelsz\u00f3nak k\u00fcl\u00f6nb\u00f6znie kell a r\u00e9git\u0151l.", // EN: New password must differ from the old one.
    "Oturum bulunamad\u0131. \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yap\u0131p tekrar giri\u015f yap.": "A munkamenet nem tal\u00e1lhat\u00f3.Jelentkezzen ki, majd jelentkezzen be \u00fajra.", // EN: Session not found. Sign out and sign in again.
    "\u015eifre g\u00fcncellenemedi.": "Nem siker\u00fclt friss\u00edteni a jelsz\u00f3t.", // EN: Could not update the password.
    "Davet e-postas\u0131 g\u00f6nderiliyor\u2026": "Megh\u00edv\u00f3 e-mail k\u00fcld\u00e9se\u2026", // EN: Sending invitation email…
    "Bu e-postan\u0131n hesab\u0131 zaten var; kodla kat\u0131labilir.": "Ez az e-mail m\u00e1r rendelkezik fi\u00f3kkal;k\u00f3ddal csatlakozhatnak.", // EN: This email already has an account; they can join with the code.
    "Ev sahibi yetkileri kapat\u0131lamaz": "A tulajdonosi enged\u00e9lyek nem kapcsolhat\u00f3k ki", // EN: Owner permissions cannot be turned off
