    "Yetkiyi a\u00e7": "Kapcsolja be az enged\u00e9lyt", // EN: Turn permission on
    "\u0130ptal edildi \u2014 d\u00f6nem sonuna kadar ge\u00e7erli": "T\u00f6r\u00f6lve \u2013 az id\u0151szak v\u00e9g\u00e9ig \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes", // EN: Cancelled — valid until the end of the period
    "Aboneli\u011fin aktif": "Az el\u0151fizet\u00e9sed akt\u00edv", // EN: Your subscription is active
    "T\u00fcketim Ge\u00e7mi\u015fi": "Haszn\u00e1lati el\u0151zm\u00e9nyek", // EN: Usage History
    "Son 7 g\u00fcn \u00b7 yaln\u0131zca bu cihazdaki ger\u00e7ek \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmlerden": "Utols\u00f3 7 nap \u00b7 csak ezen az eszk\u00f6z\u00f6n val\u00f3s m\u00e9r\u00e9sekb\u0151l", // EN: Last 7 days · from real measurements on this device only
    "Son 7 g\u00fcn": "Az elm\u00falt 7 nap", // EN: Last 7 days
    "Hen\u00fcz kay\u0131tl\u0131 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm yok. G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en bir cihaz ekleyip bu sayfay\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131nda okumalar burada birikir.": "M\u00e9r\u00e9seket m\u00e9g nem r\u00f6gz\u00edtettek.Adjon hozz\u00e1 egy teljes\u00edtm\u00e9nyt m\u00e9r\u0151 eszk\u00f6zt, \u00e9s nyissa meg ezt az oldalt;az olvasm\u00e1nyok itt fognak felhalmoz\u00f3dni.", // EN: No measurements recorded yet. Add a device that measures power and open this page; readings will build up here.
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131nmayan aral\u0131klar hesaba kat\u0131lmaz; bu y\u00fczden de\u011ferler ger\u00e7ek t\u00fcketimden d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck olabilir.": "A m\u00e9r\u00e9s n\u00e9lk\u00fcli intervallumokat nem sz\u00e1moljuk, \u00edgy az \u00e9rt\u00e9kek alacsonyabbak lehetnek a t\u00e9nyleges fogyaszt\u00e1sn\u00e1l.", // EN: Intervals without measurements are not counted, so values may be lower than actual consumption.
    "Elektrik birim fiyat\u0131 (kWh ba\u015f\u0131na)": "Villany \u00e1ra (kWh)", // EN: Electricity price (per kWh)
    "\u00d6rn. 2,50": "pl.2.50", // EN: e.g. 2.50
    "Para birimi": "P\u00e9nznem", // EN: Currency
    "Tahmini maliyet; fatura de\u011fildir. Fiyat yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda saklan\u0131r.": "Becs\u00fclt k\u00f6lts\u00e9g, nem sz\u00e1mla.Az \u00e1r csak ezen a k\u00e9sz\u00fcl\u00e9ken t\u00e1rol\u00f3dik.", // EN: Estimated cost, not a bill. The price is stored on this device only.
    "G\u00fcnl\u00fck t\u00fcketim, son 7 g\u00fcn (kWh)": "Napi haszn\u00e1lat, elm\u00falt 7 nap (kWh)", // EN: Daily usage, last 7 days (kWh)
